  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open the admin settings",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>≡</strong>, scroll the tools to <strong>OpenDefence Main</strong>, and scroll down to <strong>Server configuration (admins)</strong>. Only admins see it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f60f497bb0ed7831.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See the tree",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>ORBAT</strong>. The top unit comes first, and <strong>›</strong> goes into a unit.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/aa10480fb38b95ae.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Go into a unit",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>›</strong> on a platoon, here 1J, to see its squads. <strong>‹ 1K</strong> takes you back up.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e3b8138a9e0ff9a5.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Add a unit",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the name on the dashed row to add the next squad like the one above, or <strong>⋯</strong> to pick another kind of unit. The new squad is outlined and marked <strong>new</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/374ac95b0cfc4d5a.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open the new unit",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap › on 4R to go into it, then tap its card <strong>4R</strong> at the top to edit it. <strong>Undo (1)</strong> takes back the last change.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/02ac35e8fe7f5756.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Edit a unit",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Change the name, size or type, or tap <strong>Move…</strong> or <strong>Delete 4R…</strong>. Tap <strong>Done</strong> to close the sheet.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4ce1bc513467b94b.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Publish",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap 1J in the trail at the top to go back up. Your change stays on this phone until you publish it, and the page reads <strong>1 unpublished change</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/08275cebff333b52.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
